      <annotation addr="1A1F:4CC6">V: HandleTacticalFunctionKey_4CC6. F1-F4 select player units, F5-F7 select lance groups, F8 is unused, F9 cycles visible enemies, and F10 opens dropship/overview controls.</annotation>
