	  <annotation addr="0800:33D6">V: DecodeLinearRleScreen_33D6 expands a signed-run stream to 7D00h consecutive bytes. Positive controls copy literals, negative controls repeat one byte, and zero introduces a 16-bit repeat count.</annotation>
