	  <annotation addr="2007:16BA">V: RedrawTacticalStatusPanel_16BA preserves the selected text window, rebuilds tactical window 06h, its side indicator, and campaign clock, then restores the prior window.</annotation>
	  <annotation addr="2208:26B1">V: CompareLanceCombatRatings_26B1 aggregates the first five derived combat-rating words across two four-unit lances and returns -1, 0, or 1 from the majority of field comparisons.</annotation>
	  <annotation addr="2208:2853">P: HasActiveLanceFollowers_2853 requires a current lance leader and another deployed record later in its four-unit group; the first lance additionally requires DS:B5D8.</annotation>
	  <annotation addr="2D1B:2604">V: BuildArmWeaponAvailabilityMasks_2604 counts intact weapons in the eight left-arm and eight right-arm slots and builds the unit's 23-bit availability mask, excluding empty-ammunition weapons.</annotation>
	  <annotation addr="2D1B:296F">P: QueueLanceOrderNarration_296F queues narration category 07h for a friendly lance leader whose tactical-order mode is not 02h.</annotation>
