      <annotation addr="2D1B:0379">CalculateUnitDurabilityTotals_0379 sums current and maximum armor, or internal structure for the special terminus-state 03h path, into DS:833E and DS:86BB.</annotation>
      <annotation addr="2D1B:1854">P: ResolveWeaponAttack_1854(attackerUnitIndex, weaponIndex, targetUnitIndex); complete assembly-led attack gate, line-of-sight, to-hit, ammunition, heat, recovery, presentation, and damage-dispatch path. Return 01h means the attack reached the valid to-hit/ammunition stage, not that it hit.</annotation>
      <annotation addr="31FB:0567">V: Dispatch WeaponDefinition.effectId (+0Eh) to digital PCM when a non-PC-speaker driver is active, except ID 03h; otherwise select the same ID from the PC-speaker effect stream table.</annotation>
