      <annotation addr="0800:078C">V: TraceMapLineOfSight_078C walks a Bresenham-like grid line through the far terrain map and returns 1 on reaching the target. It returns 0 at the step limit, after three cells in the caller's special-terrain range, or at the first terrain ID at/above the blocking threshold.</annotation>
