      <annotation addr="2D1B:2453">V: DestroyScenarioUnit_2453 clears the active unit record, invalidates every attack target pointing to it, snapshots its last map coordinates into the three-byte destruction-event record, and queues friendly/enemy destruction state.</annotation>
      <annotation addr="1A1F:0CF9">V: ReadTerrainDamageState_0CF9 extracts one two-bit cell from the packed terrain-damage map and caches the selected far byte at DS:B047/B049.</annotation>
