      <annotation addr="2D1B:276F">V: ApplyTerrainImpact_276F validates a nonterminal cell, optionally advances its packed damage state, deduplicates and allocates one of 90 six-byte animation records at DS:810C, and triggers scenario-specific structure collapse on a non-recorded 2-to-3 transition. It has no meaningful return value.</annotation>
      <annotation addr="3A6A:810C">V: TerrainImpactAnimationRecords_810C contains 5Ah six-byte records: signed map X, signed map Y, and random animation variant 00h-02h. X=FFFFh marks a free record.</annotation>
      <annotation addr="3A6A:849E">V: TerrainImpactAnimationTypeMaximum_849E is the inclusive upper terrain-type bound for random DS:810C record creation.</annotation>
      <annotation addr="3A6A:855D">V: TerrainImpactAnimationTypeMinimum_855D is the inclusive lower terrain-type bound paired with DS:849E.</annotation>
      <annotation addr="2D1B:2AF3">V: CollapseStructureAtMapCell_2AF3 derives a scenario-specific 2x2 or 3x3 structure footprint, advances every cell to terminal damage, queues a heavy impact, and destroys deployed units within one cell of each footprint tile. It has no meaningful return value.</annotation>
