      <annotation addr="3A07:0001">V: ConvertLocalDateTimeToEpochSeconds_0001. Convert DOS register-order date/time fields to Unix epoch seconds in DX:AX, including the configured signed timezone offset and legacy DST adjustment.</annotation>
      <annotation addr="3A3C:01ED">V: IsDaylightSavingTime_01ED. Evaluate the runtime's legacy April-through-October daylight-saving rule; month zero means dayOrDayOfYear is already a zero-based day of year.</annotation>
