      <annotation addr="3593:0008">V: SelectResourceDrive_0008 does nothing when DS:B668 disables drive selection; otherwise it selects DOS drive A, or drive B when DS:B662 enables a secondary drive and resourceDriveIndex is positive. The descriptor value's installer/floppy-volume encoding remains unknown.</annotation>
